    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers, unite! Dive into the exhilarating world of Void Raiders, a turn-based Sci-Fi tabletop strategy game that challenges you and your friends to battle fierce aliens and formidable robots on your quest to journey home through treacherous space stations and mysterious portals. This game combines strategic thinking with cooperative gameplay, offering an immersive experience that is unique every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Strategically plan your moves, deploy your character\u2019s abilities, and outsmart your opponents in tactical battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Character Classes</strong>: Choose from a diverse range of classes, each with its own strengths, abilities, and playstyles, allowing for endless combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-Op for Up to Four Players</strong>: Team up with friends to tackle challenges together, combining your skills and strategies for maximum impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Card System</strong>: Effectively manage and play your cards to gain advantages in combat and resource management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Session Lasts About Three Hours: Perfect for a game night, this time frame offers a sense of completion without feeling rushed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and immerse yourself in the action with Void Raiders \u2014 a captivating Sci-Fi tabletop experience from Gamopolis that guarantees excitement and strategy at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your fellow adventurers and prepare for an unforgettable journey through the cosmos! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers, unite! Dive into the exhilarating world of Void Raiders, a turn-based Sci-Fi tabletop strategy game that challenges you and your friends to battle fierce aliens and formidable robots on your quest to journey home through treacherous space stations and mysterious portals. This game combines strategic thinking with cooperative gameplay, offering an immersive experience that is unique every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Turn-Based Combat</strong>: Strategically plan your moves, deploy your character\u2019s abilities, and outsmart your opponents in tactical battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Character Classes</strong>: Choose from a diverse range of classes, each with its own strengths, abilities, and playstyles, allowing for endless combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-Op for Up to Four Players</strong>: Team up with friends to tackle challenges together, combining your skills and strategies for maximum impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Card System</strong>: Effectively manage and play your cards to gain advantages in combat and resource management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Session Lasts About Three Hours: Perfect for a game night, this time frame offers a sense of completion without feeling rushed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and immerse yourself in the action with Void Raiders \u2014 a captivating Sci-Fi tabletop experience from Gamopolis that guarantees excitement and strategy at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your fellow adventurers and prepare for an unforgettable journey through the cosmos! </p>",
